{"id":"dbc0915e0402cd40","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-regular-knot-projection.md","title":"纽结正规投影的坐标数据","display":"df-regular-knot-projection — 纽结正规投影的坐标数据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-regular-knot-projection","aliases":["58-df-regular-knot-projection"],"display":"df-regular-knot-projection — 纽结正规投影的坐标数据","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-regular-knot-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-regular-knot-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-knot-projection — 纽结正规投影的坐标数据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccaaf599ec318a33\" href=\"?note=ccaaf599ec318a33\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-knot.md\">../batch05/58-df-knot.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z,Q,T\\in V\">\\(k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z,Q,T\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^d=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{d+1}:\\sum_{i=0}^{d}x_i^2=1\\}\">\\(S^d=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{d+1}:\\sum_{i=0}^{d}x_i^2=1\\}\\)</span>，与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a> 的单位球面一致。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|\\)</span> 为欧氏范数。矩阵指标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_3=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\langle2,0\\rangle,\\langle3,1\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathbb R^4\">\\(e_3=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\langle2,0\\rangle,\\langle3,1\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathbb R^4\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(t)=\\{\\langle0,\\cos t\\rangle,\\langle1,\\sin t\\rangle\\}\">\\(c(t)=\\{\\langle0,\\cos t\\rangle,\\langle1,\\sin t\\rangle\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>。下式直接用此覆盖映射定义圆周方向导数，不使用未指定的切向量坐标。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StereographicFrame}_{58,S}(Q,q,h)\">\\(\\mathrm{StereographicFrame}_{58,S}(Q,q,h)\\)</span> 和原六元接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^{4\\times4}\\coloneqq\\{Q:\\mathrm{Function}(Q,4\\times4,\\mathbb R)\\}\">\\(\\mathbb R^{4\\times4}\\coloneqq\\{Q:\\mathrm{Function}(Q,4\\times4,\\mathbb R)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Qu)_i\\coloneqq\\sum_{j\\in4}Q(\\langle i,j\\rangle)u(j)\">\\((Qu)_i\\coloneqq\\sum_{j\\in4}Q(\\langle i,j\\rangle)u(j)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Qq=e_3\\;:\\!\\!\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall i\\in4\\;((Qq)_i=e_3(i))\">\\(Qq=e_3\\;:\\!\\!\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall i\\in4\\;((Qq)_i=e_3(i))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^{\\mathsf T}Q=I_4\\;:\\!\\!\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall i,j\\in4\\;(\\sum_{r\\in4}Q(\\langle r,i\\rangle)Q(\\langle r,j\\rangle)=\\delta_{ij})\">\\(Q^{\\mathsf T}Q=I_4\\;:\\!\\!\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall i,j\\in4\\;(\\sum_{r\\in4}Q(\\langle r,i\\rangle)Q(\\langle r,j\\rangle)=\\delta_{ij})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{ij}=1\">\\(\\delta_{ij}=1\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=j\">\\(i=j\\)</span>，其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a-b=\\{\\langle i,a(i)-b(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\">\\(a-b=\\{\\langle i,a(i)-b(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ta=\\{\\langle i,ta(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\">\\(ta=\\{\\langle i,ta(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|a\\|=(\\sum_{i\\in n}a(i)^2)^{1/2}\">\\(\\|a\\|=(\\sum_{i\\in n}a(i)^2)^{1/2}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,S^1,\\mathbb R^2)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,S^1,\\mathbb R^2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall u\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;|u|&lt;\\delta\\to\n\\|\\gamma(c(t+u))-\\gamma(c(t))-uT(c(t))\\|&lt;\\epsilon|u|\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in S^1\\;\\Bigl(\\|T(a)\\|&gt;0\\land\n\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall b\\in S^1\\;\n(\\|a-b\\|&lt;\\delta\\to\\|T(a)-T(b)\\|&lt;\\epsilon)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,S^1,\\mathbb R^2)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,S^1,\\mathbb R^2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall u\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;|u|&lt;\\delta\\to\n\\|\\gamma(c(t+u))-\\gamma(c(t))-uT(c(t))\\|&lt;\\epsilon|u|\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in S^1\\;\\Bigl(\\|T(a)\\|&gt;0\\land\n\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall b\\in S^1\\;\n(\\|a-b\\|&lt;\\delta\\to\\|T(a)-T(b)\\|&lt;\\epsilon)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StereographicFrame}_{58,S}(Q,q,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nQ\\in\\mathbb R^{4\\times4}\\land Q^{\\mathsf T}Q=I_4\\land q\\in S^3\\land Qq=e_3\\\\\n&amp;\\land h=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle u,\n\\{\\langle i,(Qu)_i/(1-(Qu)_3)\\rangle:i\\in3\\}\n\\Bigr\\rangle:u\\in S^3\\setminus\\{q\\}\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StereographicFrame}_{58,S}(Q,q,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nQ\\in\\mathbb R^{4\\times4}\\land Q^{\\mathsf T}Q=I_4\\land q\\in S^3\\land Qq=e_3\\\\\n&amp;\\land h=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle u,\n\\{\\langle i,(Qu)_i/(1-(Qu)_3)\\rangle:i\\in3\\}\n\\Bigr\\rangle:u\\in S^3\\setminus\\{q\\}\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\\land q\\in S^3\\setminus k[S^1]\n\\land\\exists Q,T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StereographicFrame}_{58,S}(Q,q,h)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\pi=\\{\\langle u,\\{\\langle0,u_0\\rangle,\\langle1,u_1\\rangle\\}\\rangle:u\\in\\mathbb R^3\\}\n\\land\\gamma=\\pi\\circ h\\circ k\\\\\n&amp;\\land z=\\{\\langle a,(h(k(a)))_2\\rangle:a\\in S^1\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\\land q\\in S^3\\setminus k[S^1]\n\\land\\exists Q,T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StereographicFrame}_{58,S}(Q,q,h)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\pi=\\{\\langle u,\\{\\langle0,u_0\\rangle,\\langle1,u_1\\rangle\\}\\rangle:u\\in\\mathbb R^3\\}\n\\land\\gamma=\\pi\\circ h\\circ k\\\\\n&amp;\\land z=\\{\\langle a,(h(k(a)))_2\\rangle:a\\in S^1\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>极点、正交坐标系、立体投影、平面投影与高度函数均由同一组数据确定。分母非零由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne q\">\\(u\\ne q\\)</span> 与正交性保证。</li>\n<li>本关系保留正交坐标系的两种取向；下游带取向的完整图编码另显式选择正取向坐标系。</li>\n<li>这里只要求平面曲线为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^1\">\\(C^1\\)</span> 浸入；不擅自把上游的拓扑纽结接口改成光滑纽结接口。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-knot.md","status":"resolved","id":"ccaaf599ec318a33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../bat